  "summary": "I build things people actually use.\n \nOver 8 years I've gone from crafting pixel-perfect frontends to architecting full AWS serverless backends and everything in between. I've rebuilt e-commerce platforms from scratch, integrated Salesforce pipelines, led full product rebuilds across multiple industries, and shipped work that drives real traffic and real results.\n \nMost recently I built a free website audit tool that runs 90+ checks across 200+ data points in under 30 seconds — competing directly with paid tools, no signup required. I built it because I saw a gap and wanted to fill it. That's just how I think.\n \nI don't just write code. I own projects. From the first line of architecture to the moment something goes live and people start using it; I care about the whole picture.\n \nCurrently open to remote full stack or product engineering roles where I can actually build something meaningful, not just maintain someone else's codebase.\n \nTech I work with: React · Next.js · Node.js · AWS Lambda · PostgreSQL · Salesforce · Tailwind · CI/CD · SEO · and so much more.",
